WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,700
Don’t worry, I’ll only buy the best one and use it for five years. Any more will take up space.

2
00:00:07,700 --> 00:00:13,728
It's too convenient

3
00:00:13,728 --> 00:00:26,990
It’s too much to eat half a piece of it compared to us.

4
00:00:26,990 --> 00:00:33,200
The fresh meat is also completely smelly, so we will have to look for breeding bases in the future.

5
00:00:33,200 --> 00:00:38,260
I remember it was marked on the map that there are several small and medium-sized seed planting and breeding bases nearby.

6
00:00:38,260 --> 00:00:40,260
If you are on your way, you can go and have a look.

7
00:00:40,260 --> 00:00:43,260
Trigger the task and sweep the planting and breeding base,

8
00:00:43,260 --> 00:00:47,260
Reward planting and breeding base floor, unlimited election selection.

9
00:00:47,260 --> 00:00:50,260
You must take it, it can not only replenish fresh meat and vegetables, but also get rewards.
